# Tailscale standalone app (ADR-0000). The Standalone variant (System
# Extension, no Apple ID) is required rather than the App Store variant: only
# Standalone (and the open-source tailscaled) support running a Tailscale SSH
# server — the App Store variant is client-only there
# (https://tailscale.com/kb/1065/macos-variants, accessed 2026-09-25).
# First launch needs a one-time manual approval of the system extension in
# System Settings > Privacy & Security (see docs/operations.md).
cask "tailscale-app"
